  aciklama: "Geli\u015Ftirme zinciri (#54, #61): alt\u0131 kilit t\xFCr\xFC tek dairede.
    Kap\u0131n\u0131n \xF6n\xFCndeki ayakkab\u0131l\u0131kta tornavida; tornavidayla
    kavanoz k\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r, i\xE7inde salon anahtar\u0131; takvimde kilerin
    \u015Fifresi; kilerdeki kol Oda A'y\u0131 a\xE7ar; komodinde sigorta, buzdolab\u0131n\u0131
    a\xE7ar; buzdolab\u0131nda Oda B'nin anahtar\u0131; oyuncak kutusunda kat\u0131n
    anahtar\u0131. Banyonun mente\u015Feleri ayn\u0131 tornavidayla s\xF6k\xFCl\xFCr
    (yan oda)."
